                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "El Matador. a straight-action short-campaign (if you lower the difficulty) that shares similarity with Stranglehold and Max Payne. Why? You can slow down time and shoot-em-up.\n\n[i]Am I the only one who think the protagonist looks like Jean-Claude Van Damme? And was that Danny Trejo?[/i]\n\n[hr]\nIn case the game starts stuttering, try to restart the game or while the game opens, open task manager > go to details > find pc_matador > set_affinity > all_processors.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3796726083",
